An optional parameter has been added for the "roll" and "add" functions. It must contain an object: { direction: number, power: number }

direction - the direction of the throw in radians
power - the force of the throw (from 0 to 1)

This way, for example, swipes can be processed.

Usage example:

const Box = new DiceBox("#app", {...});

// Throw with adjustable direction and force
await Box.roll("2d6", {
direction: Math.PI / 4, // throw at an angle of 45 degrees
  power: 0.7 // 70% of maximum strength
});

// Standard random throw
await Box.roll("2d6");

